# Kotlin / Gradle

- Prefer `val`, explicit types at public API boundaries, and coroutine `Flow`
- Domain/use-case files stay JVM-pure (no `android.*` imports) so unit tests skip Robolectric
- ViewModels expose immutable UI state; no TTS or Telephony calls from Composables
- Hilt modules live next to the adapter they bind; do not use `object` service locators
- Gradle: version catalog only; fail if `com.google.android.gms` appears in dependencies
